 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Events are \"Q: <words>\" or \"L: <words>\" (lowercase alphanumeric words separated by single spaces). Each query gets the next id starting at 1 and emits \"ACK: <phrase>; ID=<id>\". A log emits \"M: <message>; Q=<ids>\" listing, ascending and comma-separated, every earlier query whose distinct words all occur among the log's words; a log with no match emits nothing.",
